hadiths[72]{hadithnumber,text}:
"399","[AI-translation] Nafi' bin Jubair bin Mut'im aur Ata bin Yasar se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Shahid Juma ka din hai, aur Mashhood Arfah ka din hai."
"400","[AI-translation] Ata bin Yasar se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"401","[AI-translation] Ibn Musayyab se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"402","[AI-translation] Safwan bin Sulaim se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab Juma ka din aur Juma ki raat ho to mujh par kasrat se durood bhejo.'"
"403","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abdur Rahman bin Ma'mar se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Juma ke din mujh par kasrat se durood bhejo.'"
"404","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ham aakhri hain aur ham sabqat le jane wale hain. Siwae is ke ke unhen ham se pahle Kitab di gai, aur hamen in ke baad di gai. To yeh woh din hai jis mein unhon ne ikhtilaf kiya, phir Allah ne hamen is ki hidayat di. To log hamare tabe hain, Yahud kal, aur Nasara parson.'"
"405","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai. Siwae is ke ke unhon ne kaha: Haathon se ke woh."
"406","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Ham aakhri hain jo qayamat ke din sabqat le jane wale hain. Siwae is ke ke unhen ham se pahle Kitab di gai, aur hamen in ke baad di gai. Phir yeh in ka din hai jo in par farz kiya gaya tha, yani Juma, phir unhon ne is mein ikhtilaf kiya. To Allah ne hamen is ki hidayat di, aur log hamare tabe hain: Hafta aur Itwar."
"407","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ka'b se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Banu Wa'il ke ek aadmi ko kahte suna: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Juma har Musalman par wajib hai siwae aurat ya bachche ya ghulam ke.'"
"408","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Har basti jis mein chalis aadmi hon to in par Juma wajib hai."
"409","[AI-translation] Ibn Sabbaq se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek Juma mein farmaya: 'Aey Musalmanon ki jama'at! Beshak yeh din hai jise Allah ne Musalmanon ke liye Eid banaya hai. To ghusl karo, aur jis ke paas khushbu ho to use lagane mein koi harj nahin. Aur tum par miswak lazim hai.'"
"410","[AI-translation] Salim se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se jo Juma ke liye aae to woh ghusl kare.'"
"411","[AI-translation] Ata bin Yasar se, Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Juma ke din ka ghusl har baligh par wajib hai."
"412","[AI-translation] Amrah se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Log khud apne kaam karne wale the, aur apni haalaton ke sath aate. To in se kaha gaya: Kash tum ghusl kar liya karo."
"413","[AI-translation] Salim se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Sahaba mein se ek aadmi Juma ke din masjid mein dakhil hua jabke Umar bin Khattab khutba de rahe the. To Umar ne farmaya: Yeh kaunsi ghadi hai? To us ne kaha: Aey Ameerul Momineen! Main bazar se wapas aaya aur azan suni, to wuzu karne ke siwa kuch zyada na kiya. To Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Wuzu bhi! Halanke tum jante ho ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen ghusl ka hukm dete the."
"414","[AI-translation] Salim bin Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Sahaba mein se ek aadmi Juma ke din masjid mein dakhil hua jabke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) khutba de rahe the. To unhon ne farmaya: Yeh kaunsi ghadi hai? Us ne kaha: Aey Ameerul Momineen! Main bazar se wapas aaya aur azan suni to wuzu karne ke siwa kuch zyada na kiya. To Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Wuzu bhi, halanke tum jante ho ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ghusl ka hukm dete the."
"415","[AI-translation] Salim se, apne walid se Malik ki hadees ke hum-ma'na riwayat hai. Aur us ne Juma ke din baghair ghusl ke dakhil hone wale ka naam Usman bin Affan bataya."
"416","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Atik Sahabi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke pote se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab tum Juma ke liye niklo to apne waqar ke sath paidal chalo."
"417","[AI-translation] Abu Salih Samman se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jis ne Juma ke din ghusl janabat jaisa ghusl kiya phir gaya to goya us ne oont qurban kiya. Aur jo doosri ghadi mein gaya to goya us ne gae qurban ki. Aur jo teesri ghadi mein gaya to goya us ne seengon wala mendha qurban kiya. Aur jo chauthi ghadi mein gaya to goya us ne murghi qurban ki. Aur jo paanchwin ghadi mein gaya to goya us ne anda qurban kiya. Phir jab imam nikle to farishte zikr sunne hazir hote hain.'"
"418","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab Juma ka din ho to masjid ke har darwaze par farishte hote hain jo logon ko in ke martabon ke mutabiq pahle phir pahle likhte hain. Phir jab imam nikle to saheefe lapait diye jate hain aur woh khutba sunte hain. Aur namaz ki taraf jaldi karne wala goya oont qurban karne wala hai, phir jo is ke baad hai woh goya gae qurban karne wala hai, phir jo is ke baad hai woh goya mendha qurban karne wala hai, yahan tak ke murghi aur ande ka zikr kiya.'"
"419","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab Juma ka din ho to woh masjid ke darwazon par baithe' aur unhon ne hadees ka zikr kiya."
"420","[AI-translation] Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se koi kisi aadmi ko is ki majlis se utha kar phir is ki jagah khud na baithe. Lekin kushadgi karo aur wus'at karo.'"
"421","[AI-translation] Ayhne walid se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi Juma ke din apni majlis se uthe phir us ki taraf wapas aae to woh is ka zyada haqdar hai.'"
"422","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Koi aadmi qasdan kisi aadmi ko is ki majlis se utha kar phir us mein na baithe.'"
"423","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi Juma ke din apne bhai ko na uthae, lekin kahe: Kushadgi karo."
"424","[AI-translation] Sa'ib bin Yazeed se riwayat hai ke Juma ki pahli azan jab imam mimbar par baithe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr aur Umar ke zamane mein hoti. Jab Usman ki khilafat hui aur log zyada ho gae to Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne doosri azan ka hukm diya aur us ke sath azan kahi gai. To muamla isi par qaim raha. Ata inkar karte the ke use Usman ne ijaad kiya aur kahte: Mu'awiyah ne use ijaad kiya, Wallahu a'lam."
"425","[AI-translation] Tsa'labah bin Abi Malik se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke unhon ne unhen khabar di ke woh Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke zamane mein Juma ke din namaz padhte yahan tak ke Umar bin Khattab bahar tashreef laate. Jab imam bahar aata aur mimbar par baithta to muazzin azan kahta aur woh baithe baaten karte yahan tak ke jab muazzin khamosh hote aur Umar khade hote to woh khamosh ho jate aur koi baat na karta."
"426","[AI-translation] Tsa'labah bin Abi Malik se riwayat hai ke imam ka baithna nafl namaz ko qata' karta hai, aur is ka kalam guftagu ko qata' karta hai. Woh Juma ke din baaten karte jabke Umar mimbar par baithe hote. Jab muazzin khamosh hota to Umar khade hote aur koi baat na karta yahan tak ke donon khutbe mukammal kar lete. Jab namaz khadi ki jati aur Umar utarte to woh baaten karte."
"427","[AI-translation] Ibn Musayyab se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum apne sathi se kaho: Khamosh raho, jabke imam khutba de raha ho, to tum ne laghw kiya."
"428","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum apne sathi se kaho: Khamosh raho, jabke imam Juma ke din khutba de raha ho, to tum ne laghw kiya."
"429","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ke hum-ma'na riwayat hai, siwae is ke ke unhon ne kaha: Tum ne laghw kiya. Ibn Uyainah ne kaha: Laghaita Abu Hurairah ki zaban hai."
"430","[AI-translation] Malik bin Abi Aamir se riwayat hai ke Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) apne khutbe mein kaha karte, jab khutba dete to ise kam hi chhodte: Jab imam Juma ke din khutba dene khada ho to suno aur khamosh raho. Beshak khamosh rahne wale ke liye jo nahin sunta utna hissa hai jitna sunne wale khamosh rahne wale ke liye hai. Aur jab namaz khadi ki jae to safen seedhi karo, aur kandhon ko barabar karo, kyunke safon ka seedha karna namaz ke mukammal hone mein se hai. Phir Usman takbeer na kahte yahan tak ke in ke paas woh aadmi aate jinhen unhon ne safen durust karne par muqarrar kiya tha, aur woh unhen khabar dete ke safen seedhi ho gai hain to woh takbeer kahte."
"431","[AI-translation] Amr bin Dinar se, Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Juma ke din masjid mein dakhil hua jabke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khutba de rahe the. To Aap ne un se farmaya: 'Kya tum ne namaz padhi?' Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: 'Do rak'aten padho.'"
"432","[AI-translation] Jabir se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai. Aur Jabir ki hadees mein izafa kiya: Woh Sulaik Ghatafani tha."
"433","[AI-translation] Iyadh se, Abdullah bin Sa'd bin Abi Sarh se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Sa'id Khudri ko dekha ke woh aae jabke Marwan khutba de raha tha. To woh khade hue aur do rak'aten padhin. To in ke paas pahredar aae taake unhen bithayen, magar unhon ne baithne se inkar kiya yahan tak ke do rak'aten padhin. Jab ham namaz se farigh hue to ham in ke paas aae aur kaha: Aey Abu Sa'id! Qareeb tha ke woh tumhare sath kuch karte. To unhon ne kaha: Main use kisi cheez ke liye nahin chhodunga us cheez ke baad jo main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se dekhi. Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha jab ek aadmi aaya jabke Aap khutba de rahe the. Woh masjid mein purani haalat mein dakhil hua. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya tum ne namaz padhi?' Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: 'Do rak'aten padho.' Unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ne logon ko sadqa ki targheeb di, to unhon ne kapde phenke aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un mein se is aadmi ko do kapde diye. Phir jab agli Juma hui to woh aadmi aaya jabke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khutba de rahe the. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Kya tum ne namaz padhi?' Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: 'Do rak'aten padho.' Phir Aap ne logon ko sadqa ki targheeb di, yani us aadmi ne apna ek kapda phenk diya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) cheekhe aur farmaya: 'Use le lo, use le lo.' Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Is aadmi ko dekho jo us Juma purani haalat mein aaya tha to main ne logon ko sadqa ka hukm diya aur unhon ne kapde phenke aur main ne un mein se use do kapde diye. Phir jab Juma aaya to main ne logon ko sadqa ka hukm diya phir woh aaya aur us ne apna ek kapda phenk diya.'"
"434","[AI-translation] Amr bin Dinar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar us aadmi se farmate jab use Juma ke din oongh aati jabke imam khutba de raha hota: Ke woh wahan se hat jae."
"435","[AI-translation] Hisham se, Hasan se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab koi aadmi chheenke jabke imam Juma ke din khutba de raha ho to is ka jawab do.'"
"436","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Juma ke din do khutbe khade ho kar dete aur donon ke darmiyan baith kar fasl karte."
"437","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"438","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr, Umar aur Usman se riwayat hai ke woh Juma ke din mimbar par do khutbe khade ho kar dete aur donon ke darmiyan baith kar fasl karte, yahan tak ke Mu'awiyah pahle khutbe mein baith gaya aur baith kar khutba diya, aur doosre mein khade ho kar khutba diya."
"439","[AI-translation] Khubaib bin Abdur Rahman bin Isaf se, Umm Hisham bint Harisah bin Nu'man se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Qaf padhte suna jabke Aap Juma ke din mimbar par khutba de rahe the. Aur unhon ne use Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Juma ke din jabke Aap mimbar par the ke siwa kahin se yaad nahin kiya, is wajah se ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Juma ke din jabke Aap mimbar par hote kasrat se use padhte."
"440","[AI-translation] Umm Hisham bint Harisah bin Nu'man se isi ki misl riwayat hai. Ibrahim ne kaha: Main nahin janta magar main ne Abu Bakr bin Hazm ko Juma ke din mimbar par use padhte suna. Ibrahim ne kaha: Main ne Muhammad bin Abi Bakr ko use padhte suna, jabke woh us din Madinah ke qazi the, mimbar par."
"441","[AI-translation] Husain bin Muhammad bin Ali bin Abi Talib se riwayat hai ke Umar apne khutbe mein Juma ke din padhte: Jab suraj lapaita jaega [Takwir: 1] yahan tak ke pahunche: Har jaan jaan legi jo woh laai [Takwir: 14], phir woh surah qata' kar dete."
"442","[AI-translation] Urwah se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Umar ne mimbar par yahi padha."
"443","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ata se poocha: Kya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab khutba dete to asa par khade hote? Unhon ne kaha: Han, is par sahara lete."
"444","[AI-translation] Kuraib Maula Ibn Abbas se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek din khutba diya aur farmaya: 'Beshak hamd Allah ke liye hai, ham Us se madad mangte hain, Us se maghfirat mangte hain, Us se hidayat mangte hain aur Us se nusrat mangte hain. Aur ham Allah ki panah mangte hain apne nafson ke shar se aur apne bure a'mal se. Jise Allah hidayat de use koi gumrah nahin kar sakta, aur jise woh gumrah kare use koi hidayat nahin de sakta. Aur main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahin aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad Us ke bande aur Us ke Rasool hain. Jo Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki ita'at kare to woh hidayat pa gaya, aur jo Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki nafarmani kare to woh gumrah ho gaya yahan tak ke woh Allah ke hukm ki taraf wapas aae.'"
"445","[AI-translation] Amr se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek din khutba diya aur apne khutbe mein farmaya: Khabardar! Duniya hazir punji hai, is mein se naik aur badkar khate hain. Khabardar! Aakhirat sachcha wa'da hai, is mein Qadir Badshah faisla karega. Khabardar! Beshak tamam bhalai apne tamam pahluon ke sath Jannat mein hai. Khabardar! Beshak tamam burai apne tamam pahluon ke sath Jahannam mein hai. To khabardar, aur jano ke tum Allah ke han darte hue ho. Aur jano ke tum apne a'mal par pesh kiye jaoge. Jo zarra barabar bhalai karega woh use dekhega, aur jo zarra barabar burai karega woh use dekhega [Zalzalah: 7-8]."
"446","[AI-translation] Tamim bin Tarafah se, Adi bin Hatim se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas khutba diya aur kaha: Jo Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki ita'at kare to woh hidayat pa gaya, jo in donon ki nafarmani kare to woh gumrah ho gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khamosh ho jao, tum bure khateeb ho. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki ita'at kare to woh hidayat pa gaya, aur jo Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki nafarmani kare to woh gumrah ho gaya. Aur na kaho: Jo in donon ki nafarmani kare."
"447","[AI-translation] Muttalib bin Hantab se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Juma ki namaz padhte jab saya ek hath ya is jaise ho jata."
"448","[AI-translation] Yusuf bin Mahak se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mu'az Makkah walon ke paas aae jabke woh Juma ki namaz padh rahe the aur saya Hijr mein tha. To unhon ne kaha: Namaz na padho yahan tak ke Ka'ba apne chehre se saya daar ho jae."
"449","[AI-translation] Sa'id Maqburi se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Juma ki do rak'aton mein Surah Jumu'ah aur Munafiqun padhin."
"450","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abi Rafi' se, Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Juma mein Surah Jumu'ah aur Iza Ja'akal Munafiqun padhin. Ubaidullah ne kaha: To main ne un se kaha: Tum ne do suraten padhin jo Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) Juma mein padha karte the. To unhon ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unhen padha karte the."
"451","[AI-translation] Ma'bad bin Khalid se, Samurah bin Jundub se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap Juma mein padhte: Sabbihisma Rabbikal A'la aur Hal Ataka Hadeesul Ghashiyah."
"452","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abi Rafi' se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Surah Jumu'ah ke baad Iza Ja'akal Munafiqun padhi."
"453","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Zahhak bin Qais ne Nu'man bin Basheer se poocha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Juma ke din Surah Jumu'ah ke baad kya padhte the? To unhon ne kaha: Aap padhte the: Hal Ataka Hadeesul Ghashiyah."
"454","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Juma ke din khutba dete. Aap ka ek bazar tha jise Batha kaha jata tha, Banu Sulaim wahan ghode, oont, bakriyan aur ghee laate. Woh aae to log in ki taraf nikal gae aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko chhod diya. In ka ek khel tha ke jab Ansar mein se koi shadi karta to woh daf bajate. To Allah Ta'ala ne in par is se etiraz farmaya aur farmaya: Aur jab woh tijarat ya khel dekhte hain to is ki taraf bikhar jate hain aur tumhen khada chhod dete hain [Jumu'ah: 11]."
"455","[AI-translation] Ibrahim bin Abdullah bin Ma'bad se, apne walid se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo baghair zaroorat ke Juma chhod de woh munafiq likha jata hai aisi kitab mein jo na mitai jati hai aur na badli jati hai.' Aur baaz hadees mein hai: 'Teen martaba.'"
"456","[AI-translation] Ubaidah bin Sufyan Hazrami se, Abul Ja'd Zamri se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo shakhs teen martaba susti ki wajah se Juma chhod de magar Allah is ke dil par mohar laga deta hai.' Shafi'i ne farmaya: Aur baaz hadees mein hai: 'Teen martaba.'"
"457","[AI-translation] Ubaidah bin Sufyan Hazrami se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Amr bin Abi Umayyah ko kahte suna: Koi Musalman aadmi teen martaba susti ki wajah se Juma nahin chhodta ke us mein hazir na ho magar woh ghafilon mein likha jata hai."
"458","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab ne ek aadmi ko safar ki haalat mein dekha aur use kahte suna: Agar aaj Juma ka din na hota to main nikal jata. To Umar ne farmaya: Niklo, kyunke Juma safar se nahin rokta."
"459","[AI-translation] Isma'il bin Abdur Rahman bin Abi Zi'b se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Umar ko Sa'id bin Zaid ke liye bulaya gaya jabke woh faut ho rahe the, jabke Ibn Umar Juma ke liye ghusl kar rahe the. To woh in ke paas aae aur Juma chhod diya."
"460","[AI-translation] Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se isi ki misl ya is ke hum-ma'na riwayat hai."
"461","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Umair se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Anas bin Malik ko kahte suna: Jibra'il Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas safed aaina lae jis mein ek nukta tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yeh kya hai?' Unhon ne kaha: Yeh Juma hai, is ke zariye tumhen aur tumhari ummat ko fazeelat di gai hai. Log is mein tumhare tabe hain: Yahud aur Nasara. Aur tumhare liye is mein bhalai hai. Aur is mein ek ghadi hai jis mein koi momin Allah se bhalai ki dua kare magar us ke liye qabool ki jati hai. Aur woh hamare han Mazeed ka din hai. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aey Jibra'il! Mazeed ka din kya hai?' Unhon ne kaha: Beshak tumhare Rab ne Firdaus mein ek khula wadi banaya hai jis mein mushk ke teele hain. Jab Juma ka din ho to Allah jitne farishte chahta hai utarta hai aur is ke ird gird noor ke mimbar hain jin par Anbiya ke baithne ki jagahen hain. Aur in mimbaron ko sone ke mimbaron ne ghera hua hai jo yaqoot aur zabarjad se aarasta hain, in par shuhada aur siddeeqeen hain. Woh in ke peeche in teelon par baithe. To Allah un se farmata hai: Main tumhara Rab hun, main ne tum se apna wa'da sach kar dikhaya, to mujh se mango main tumhen dunga. To woh kahte hain: Aey hamare Rab! Ham Teri raza mangte hain. To woh farmata hai: Main tum se raazi ho gaya, aur tumhare liye jo tum ne tamanna ki is par hai aur mere paas mazeed hai. Woh Juma ke din se muhabbat karte hain is bhalai ki wajah se jo in ka Rab unhen us mein deta hai. Aur woh woh din hai jis mein tumhara Rab Arsh par mustawi hua, aur is mein Adam paida kiye gae, aur is mein Qayamat qaim hogi."
"462","[AI-translation] Anas se is jaisi riwayat hai aur us ne is par izafa kiya: 'Aur tumhare liye is mein bhalai hai, jo is mein bhalai ki dua kare jo is ke hisse mein hai to use di jati hai. Aur agar is ke hisse mein nahin to is ke liye woh zakheera kar di jati hai jo is se behtar hai.' Aur us ne is mein duniya ka bhi izafa kiya."
"463","[AI-translation] Amr bin Shurahbil bin Sa'd se, apne walid se, apne dada se riwayat hai ke Ansar ka ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Hamen Juma ke bare mein khabar den, is mein kya bhalai hai? To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Is mein paanch khaslaten hain: Is mein Adam paida kiye gae, aur is mein Allah ne Adam ko zameen par utara, aur is mein Allah ne Adam ko wafat di, aur is mein ek ghadi hai jis mein banda jo bhi mange woh use diya jata hai jab tak woh gunah ya qata' rahmi na mange, aur is mein Qayamat qaim hogi. Koi muqarrab farishta, aasman, zameen aur pahad nahin magar woh Juma ke din se darta hai."
"464","[AI-translation] A'raj se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Juma ke din ka zikr kiya aur farmaya: Is mein ek ghadi hai jis mein koi Musalman muwafiq ho jabke woh khada namaz padh raha ho aur Allah se kuch mange magar Woh use de deta hai. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne hath se ishara kiya use thoda batate hue."
"465","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jis din suraj tulu hota hai un mein sab se behtar din Juma ka din hai. Is mein Adam paida kiye gae, is mein woh utare gae, is mein in ki tauba qabool ki gai, is mein woh faut hue, aur is mein Qayamat qaim hogi. Koi jandar nahin magar woh Juma ke din subah se suraj tulu hone tak kaan lagaae rahta hai Qayamat ke khauf se, siwae jinn aur ins ke. Is mein ek ghadi hai jis mein koi Musalman banda muwafiq ho kar Allah se kuch mange magar Woh use de deta hai.' Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Abdullah bin Salam ne kaha: Woh Juma ke din ki aakhri ghadi hai. To main ne un se kaha: Woh aakhri ghadi kaise ho sakti hai? Halanke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Koi Musalman banda is ke muwafiq nahin hota jabke woh namaz padh raha ho', jabke woh aisi ghadi hai jis mein namaz nahin padhi jati? Ibn Salam ne kaha: Kya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne nahin farmaya: 'Jo majlis mein baith kar namaz ka intezar kare woh namaz mein hai yahan tak ke woh namaz padhe?' Unhon ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Han. Unhon ne kaha: To woh wahi hai."
"466","[AI-translation] Ibn Musayyab se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Dinon ka sardar Juma ka din hai.'"
"467","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab se riwayat hai ke unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe sab se zyada pasandeeda din jis mein main marna chahun Juma ke din ka chasht ka waqt hai."
"468","[AI-translation] Tufail bin Ubayy bin Ka'b se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek tane ki taraf munh karke namaz padhte jab masjid chhappar wali thi. Aur Aap is tane ki taraf khutba dete. To Aap ke Sahaba mein se ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya ham Aap ke liye ek mimbar bana den jis par Aap Juma ke din khade hon aur log Aap ka khutba sunen? Aap ne farmaya: 'Han'. Aur teen seedhiyan banai gain, wahi jo mimbar par hain. Jab mimbar banaya gaya aur use us jagah rakha gaya jahan use Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne rakha, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne irada kiya ke is mimbar par khade ho kar khutba den. To Aap is ki taraf chale. Jab us tane se aage badhe jis ki taraf Aap khutba dete the to woh rone laga yahan tak ke phat gaya aur cheer diya gaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab tane ki awaz suni to utre aur use apne hath se thapthapaya. Phir mimbar ki taraf wapas aae. Jab masjid girai gai to Ubayy bin Ka'b ne woh tana le liya, aur woh in ke ghar mein raha yahan tak ke bosida ho gaya, use deemak ne kha liya aur woh mitti ho gaya."
"469","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab khutba dete to masjid ke sutoonon mein se khajoor ke tane se tek lagate. Jab Aap ke liye mimbar banaya gaya aur Aap us par mustawi hue to woh sutoon oontni ke rone ki tarah beqarar hua yahan tak ke masjid walon ne use suna, yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) utre aur use gale lagaya to woh khamosh ho gaya."
"470","[AI-translation] Abu Hazim se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne Sahl bin Sa'd se poocha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka mimbar kis cheez se tha? Unhon ne kaha: Logon mein se koi mujh se zyada janne wala baqi nahin raha: Ghaba ke jhao se, use falan ne banaya jo falan aurat ka ghulam tha. Aur beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha jab Aap us par chadhe to qibla ki taraf munh kiya, phir takbeer kahi, phir qiraat ki phir ruku' kiya phir peeche hatte hue utre phir sajda kiya phir chadhe aur qiraat ki phir ruku' kiya phir peeche hatte hue utre phir sajda kiya."
